  "body_html": "<p>Unleash the spirit of the game with the Jeminise Soccer Player Comforter Set, a vibrant addition designed to inspire young soccer enthusiasts. This set is perfect for creating a dynamic soccer-themed bedroom, fueling dreams of the field with personalized touches.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Soccer Enthusiasm:</strong> Designed for young soccer fans, inspiring them with the excitement of their favorite sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features custom options for names and numbers, making it a unique gift for any soccer fan.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy to Use Bedding:</strong> Equipped with a hidden zipper and a smooth metal pull for convenient duvet insertion and removal.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing Process:</strong> Utilizes environmental protection techniques to ensure dye retention and prevent fading, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and dries quickly, maintaining its fluffiness over time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a duvet cover and two pillowcases.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>A4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Soccer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Soccer Player Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover, 2 Pillowcases</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Text input (Name &amp; Number)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Full</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Length</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Width</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>360</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
